  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MC International: Strengthening Music Education in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening music education in Southern Africa. Establishinh Music Crossroads Academies in Malawi, Mozambique and Zimbabwe. Overall goal is an enriched music sector in Malawi, Mozambique and Zimbabwe. The specific project goal is &#x201C;Relevant, affordable and accessible quality music education to young talented musicians in Malawi, Mozambique and Zimbabwe&#x201D;.</narrative>
  </description>
